        <div class="cav">Encoding, not hiding</div>
        <h1>Base64 Is <em>Not Encryption</em></h1>
        <p class="dek">Base64 turns up everywhere, from data URLs to JWTs, and it is constantly mistaken for a way to hide data. Here is what it actually does, why it makes files bigger, why emoji sometimes break, and why a secret pasted into the wrong tool is not safe.</p>
